    "change_digit",
    "swap_sign",
    "swap_fraction",
    "swap_script",
    "change_variable",
    "drop_term"
  ],
  "method": "Each expression is a printed equation the closed-form alt text guard accepts, so its truthful reading could be staged. Each edit is one symbol away from that truth and is also accepted by the guard, so only the second reading can refuse it. Edits are written by kind for every expression the kind applies to. None was selected or dropped for how closely it resembles the truth when rendered. This file is separate from manifest.json, which calibrates the visual filter on one to three glyph near misses.",
